{"id": "page-doc-runbook", "input": {"organization_id": "11111111-1111-7111-8111-111111111111", "capability_version": "1.0.0", "history": [{"role": "user", "text": "When does the on-call rota change?"}], "context": {"pages": [{"id": "page-doc-runbook", "title": "Incident runbook", "text": "# Incident runbook\n\n## Paging\n\nAlerts page the on-call engineer through the paging service.\n\nThe on-call rota changes every Sunday at 09:00.\n\n## Escalation\n\nAfter fifteen minutes without acknowledgement the lead is paged.\n\nAfter thirty minutes a bridge call is opened and the status page is updated.\n\n## Rollback\n\nA rollback needs the release manager's approval in the release hub.\n\nThe rollback command lives in the deploy repository under scripts.\n"}]}}, "tags": ["answerable", "page"], "expected": {"source_id": "page-doc-runbook", "keyword": "Sunday"}}
{"id": "page-doc-onboarding", "input": {"organization_id": "11111111-1111-7111-8111-111111111111", "capability_version": "1.0.0", "history": [{"role": "user", "text": "What does a new member receive on the first day?"}], "context": {"pages": [{"id": "page-doc-onboarding", "title": "Onboarding guide", "text": "# Onboarding guide\n\n## First day\n\nNew members receive a laptop on the first day.\n\nAccounts are created by the platform team within two business days.\n\n## First week\n\nEvery new member pairs with a buddy for the first week.\n\nThe buddy books the introduction meetings with each hub owner.\n\n## Access\n\nAccess to production is granted only after the security briefing.\n\nThe security briefing runs every second Tuesday.\n"}]}}, "tags": ["answerable", "page"], "expected": {"source_id": "page-doc-onboarding", "keyword": "laptop"}}
{"id": "page-doc-release", "input": {"organization_id": "11111111-1111-7111-8111-111111111111", "capability_version": "1.0.0", "history": [{"role": "user", "text": "How often do releases ship?"}], "context": {"pages": [{"id": "page-doc-release", "title": "Release process", "text": "# Release process\n\n## Cadence\n\nReleases ship every two weeks on a Wednesday.\n\nA release freeze starts on the Monday before the release.\n\n## Sign-off\n\nEach release needs sign-off from the test lead and the release manager.\n\nSign-off is recorded in the release hub before the freeze ends.\n\n## Hotfixes\n\nA hotfix skips the freeze but still needs the test lead's sign-off.\n\nHotfixes are tagged with the suffix hotfix in the version.\n"}]}}, "tags": ["answerable", "page"], "expected": {"source_id": "page-doc-release", "keyword": "two weeks"}}
{"id": "page-doc-export", "input": {"organization_id": "11111111-1111-7111-8111-111111111111", "capability_version": "1.0.0", "history": [{"role": "user", "text": "Which columns does the export write?"}], "context": {"pages": [{"id": "page-doc-export", "title": "Board export", "text": "# Board export\n\n## Columns\n\nThe export writes every visible column of the board to a CSV file.\n\nHidden columns are never exported.\n\n## Limits\n\nAn export covers at most five thousand rows.\n\nLarger boards are exported in pages named by their page number.\n\n## Permissions\n\nOnly members with the export permission see the export button.\n\nThe permission is granted per project by the project admin.\n"}]}}, "tags": ["answerable", "page"], "expected": {"source_id": "page-doc-export", "keyword": "visible"}}
{"id": "page-doc-billing", "input": {"organization_id": "11111111-1111-7111-8111-111111111111", "capability_version": "1.0.0", "history": [{"role": "user", "text": "When does billing move to the new gateway?"}], "context": {"pages": [{"id": "page-doc-billing", "title": "Billing gateway", "text": "# Billing gateway\n\n## Cut-over\n\nBilling moves to the new gateway on the first of November.\n\nThe old gateway stays in read-only mode for ninety days.\n\n## Retries\n\nA failed charge is retried three times, one hour apart.\n\nAfter the third failure the invoice is marked as unpaid.\n"}]}}, "tags": ["answerable", "page"], "expected": {"source_id": "page-doc-billing", "keyword": "November"}}
